The Joint Chamber Mixer: Architecture, Construction, and Design was held on Wednesday, September 27, 2023.&nbsp;
This event was organized jointly by the French, Canadian, and German Chambers in Japan, bringing together professionals and enthusiasts from diverse backgrounds.
The venue itself, 21_21 DESIGN SIGHT, situated within the Tokyo Midtown complex, set the stage for an evening of creative exploration. Attendees immersed themselves in the "Materials Unearthed" exhibition, delving into the world of contemporary design and materials.&nbsp;
After the museum tour, the event continued at the nearby 512 Cafe &amp; Grill, where Michel van Ackere delivered an engaging keynote speech, offering insights and perspectives on the intersection of architecture, construction, and design.&nbsp;
